    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1407">

                <pb facs="1320" n="1154" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1154"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11C64/30</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1149</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 27, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that since the
                    new administration came into power I have taken up with the present Secretary of
                    Foreign Affairs a number of the matters pending with Panama, among them those of
                    the riots of February 14, 1915, and of April 2, 1915, hoping for some action in
                    them. Following a conference I sent a formal note, a copy of which is
                    enclosed.</p>
                <p>I enclose, also, a copy and translation of the response received to my note
                    mentioned above. The new criminal judge referred to in Señor Garay’s note will
                    take possession of his office, I am informed, within the next day or two. He is
                    Señor Don Ladislao Sosa, who has been Acting Secretary of Public Works in the
                    Cabinet of former President Porras since the resignation of Señor Don Ramon F.
                    Acevedo about two years ago.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Jennings Price</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>




                <xi:include href="d1407-a1.xml" xpointer="d1407-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d1407-a2.xml" xpointer="d1407-a2"/>
